course: dictionary
lesson: 10229
title: A name, a jug or a dog?
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A word with a capital letter in the middle of a sentence is often a name. Names are called proper nouns, and they name one particular person, pet, place or character. «Toby's friend says Fleming found penicillin and saved everybody in like a day.» The capital T and the word's place in the sentence tell you Toby is a boy's name.
explain: Some words look the same but mean different things, so check the words around them. «A toby jug» has a small t, so it is an ordinary noun: a kind of old-fashioned china jug or mug. It is shaped like a fat, jolly man wearing a three-cornered hat. Look for clues like a capital letter, a lower-case letter, or words such as "a" and "the."
explain: Ask yourself: is this a person, a pet, a character, or a thing? Then try your meaning in the sentence and check that it still makes sense. If you are not sure, read the whole sentence again, then look the word up in a dictionary.
fact: A proper noun is the name of a particular person, place, pet or character, and it begins with a capital letter.
fact: «Toby» is a boy's name.
fact: A toby jug is an old-fashioned china jug or mug shaped like a fat, jolly man wearing a three-cornered hat.
fact: In Punch and Judy puppet shows, the dog is traditionally called Toby.
fact: Some grandparents collect toby jugs and keep them on a shelf as ornaments.
exercise: «Toby's friend says Fleming found penicillin and saved everybody in like a day.» In this sentence, what is Toby? | A puppet show | *A name, for a boy | A jolly man in a hat | A kind of china mug
exercise: Why does the T in «Toby» have a capital letter? | Because it is a jug | *Because Toby is a name | Because it is the first word of the book | Because it is very important
exercise: Grandma has a shelf of toby jugs. What is a toby jug? | A boy's name | *An old-fashioned china jug shaped like a jolly man in a three-cornered hat | A puppet dog in a show | A kind of sandwich
test: In the Punch and Judy show, what is the traditional name of the dog? | Max | Spot | *Toby | Rex
test: Which word is a proper noun? | *Toby | china | jug | hat
exam: A toby jug is shaped like which kind of person? | A boy running a shop | A thin, sad lady | A tall, quiet giant | *A fat, jolly man in a three-cornered hat
